        {
          "id": 3084533985,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "This seems like a sane suggestion and figured it should be easy to implement if that's the only thing holding up the MR.  However, after testing (from latest master), this MR doesn't actually do anything.\nPacketList::resizeAllColumns() is only called with onlyTimeFormatted parameter set to true, which means it only adjusts time formatted columns of which COL_INFO isn't one of them, so the new code is never hit.",
